{"schemaVersion":1,"sourceRecord":{"schemaVersion":1,"recordId":"wikibooks-39507-r4587292","sourceId":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa","sourceTitle":"Cookbook:Cherry Brownies","sourcePageId":39507,"sourceRevision":"4587292","sourceRevisionTimestamp":"2025-10-26T23:34:48Z","sourceRevisionUser":"Codename Noreste","sourceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/w/index.php?title=Cookbook:Cherry%20Brownies&oldid=4587292","retrievedAt":"2026-10-13T12:35:17.827Z","sourceCategories":["Category:Baking recipes","Category:Medium Difficulty recipes","Category:Recipes","Category:Recipes for bars","Category:Recipes for brownies","Category:Recipes for dessert","Category:Recipes using cherry","Category:Recipes using cocoa powder","Category:Recipes using cream cheese","Category:Recipes using dark chocolate","Category:Recipes using egg","Category:Recipes using maraschino cherry","Category:Recipes using margarine","Category:Recipes using powdered sugar","Category:Recipes using wheat flour","Category:Recipes using white sugar","Category:Recipes with metric units"],"license":{"id":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa-4.0","name":"Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0); Wikibooks text is generally dual-licensed with GFDL unless otherwise noted","evidenceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Wikibooks:Copyrights","policyStatus":"verified-license","pageExceptionStatus":"not-reviewed-per-page","attribution":"Attribute Wikibooks contributors by linking each version-specific source page. Indicate that structured fields are extracted and any translated or edited text is modified. Include CC BY-SA 4.0 notice/link and share adaptations under CC BY-SA 4.0 or later.","changeNoticeRequired":true,"shareAlikeRequired":true},"sourceSha256":"c9815c86aecc13cba5d2bad015a205c72efe7faffc794c7262f65231474a72c5","sourceWikitext":"__NOTOC__\n{{recipesummary|category=Recipes for dessert|servings=36|time=50 minutes|difficulty=3|energy=78 Cal per serving}}\n{{recipe|Brownies, Cherry}} | [[Cookbook:Dessert|Dessert]]\n\n'''Cherry brownies''' are a rich [[Cookbook:Brownies|brownie]] with no frosting, a fudge-like base, and a [[Cookbook:Cheesecake|cheesecake]]-like top, filled with maraschino cherries and chocolate chips.\n\n== Ingredients ==\n\n=== Base ===\n* 2 [[Cookbook:Each|ea]]. (100 g) [[Cookbook:Egg|eggs]]\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Cup|cup]] (2.4 [[Cookbook:Deciliter|dl]]) white granulated [[Cookbook:sugar|sugar]]\n* 6 [[Cookbook:Tablespoon|tbsp]] [[Cookbook:Margarine|margarine]]\n* &frac14; [[Cookbook:Cup|cup]] (0.6 dl) [[Cookbook:Cocoa|cocoa]]\n* &frac34; [[Cookbook:Cup|cup]] (1.8 dl) [[Cookbook:Flour|flour]]\n* &frac14; [[Cookbook:Teaspoon|tsp]] [[Cookbook:Salt|salt]]\n\n=== Topping ===\n* 4 [[Cookbook:Ounce|ounces]] (110 [[Cookbook:Gram|g]]) softened [[cookbook:Cream Cheese|cream cheese]]\n* &frac14; [[Cookbook:Cup|cup]] (0.6 dl) [[Cookbook:Maraschino Cherry|maraschino cherry]] syrup\n* &frac14; [[Cookbook:Cup|cup]] (0.6 dl) [[cookbook:icing sugar|icing sugar]]\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Egg|egg]]\n* &frac12; [[Cookbook:Cup|cup]] (1.2 dl) semi-sweet [[cookbook:Chocolate chip|chocolate chips]]\n* &frac12; [[Cookbook:Cup|cup]] (1.2 dl) [[cookbook:Cherry|maraschino cherries]]\n\n== Procedure ==\n\n=== Base ===\n# Melt margarine in a [[cookbook:saucepan|saucepan]] over medium-low heat, then mix in the cocoa.\n# Add the sugar, salt, and eggs. Mix well and then [[cookbook:fold|fold]] in the flour.\n# Spread in a greased 9 x 9-inch (22 x 22 cm) [[Cookbook:Cake Pan|cake pan]] and set aside.\n\n=== Topping ===\n# [[cookbook:Beat|Beat]] the cream cheese, cherry syrup and icing sugar together in a bowl until creamy.\n# Add the egg to the mixture and blend well.\n# Mix in the chocolate chips and cherries.\n# Pour the second mixture over top the base.\n\n=== Baking ===\n# [[Cookbook:Baking|Bake]] at 350 &deg;F/175 &deg;C for 30–40 minutes, until a [[Cookbook:Toothpick|toothpick]] poked through the centre comes out moist (but not wet with batter).\n#  Let cool and cut into 36 squares.\n\n== Notes, tips and variations ==\n\n* Cool for at least 10 minutes before cutting and eating or you will have hot broken brownies. \n\n{{DEFAULTSORT:Brownies, Cherry}}\n[[Category:Recipes for brownies]]\n[[Category:Recipes using dark chocolate]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cherry]]\n[[Category:Baking recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes with metric units]]\n[[Category:Recipes for dessert]]\n[[Category:Recipes for bars]]\n[[Category:Recipes using white sugar]]\n[[Category:Recipes using powdered sugar]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cocoa powder]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cream cheese]]\n[[Category:Recipes using egg]]\n[[Category:Recipes using wheat flour]]\n[[Category:Recipes using maraschino cherry]]\n[[Category:Recipes using margarine]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Cherry Brownies","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"2 ea. (100 g) eggs","sourceText":"2 ea. (100 g) eggs","amountText":"2 ea. (100 g) eggs","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"1 cup (2.4 dl) white granulated sugar","sourceText":"1 cup (2.4 dl) white granulated sugar","amountText":"1 cup (2.4 dl) white granulated sugar","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"6 tbsp margarine","sourceText":"6 tbsp margarine","amountText":"6 tbsp margarine","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"&frac14; cup (0.6 dl) cocoa","sourceText":"&frac14; cup (0.6 dl) cocoa","amountText":"&frac14; cup (0.6 dl) cocoa","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-5","name":"&frac34; cup (1.8 dl) flour","sourceText":"&frac34; cup (1.8 dl) flour","amountText":"&frac34; cup (1.8 dl) flour","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-6","name":"&frac14; tsp salt","sourceText":"&frac14; tsp salt","amountText":"&frac14; tsp salt","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-7","name":"4 ounces (110 g) softene